        "evidence_id": "E9",
        "quote": "the average annual State Pension (\u00a39,500 after a 10.1% increase in April 2023) remains below the \u00a312,800 per year required for a \"minimum\" lifestyle as defined by the Pensions and Lifetime Savings Association"
      },
      {
        "tier": "measurable",
        "claim": "One in six pensioners still lives in relative poverty, showing the triple lock has not eliminated hardship.",
        "evidence_id": "E8",
        "quote": "one in six pensioners living in relative poverty"
      },
      {
