        "quote": "pensioner poverty rates have risen by 2.3 percentage points in the 12 years following its introduction"
      },
      {
        "tier": "projected",
        "claim": "The IFS estimates the triple lock costs \u00a312 billion more annually in 2025-26 than earnings-only uprating would have.",
        "evidence_id": "E14",
        "quote": "the triple lock has increased annual government spending by \u00a312 billion more in 2025-26 than if it had been uprated in line with average earnings since 2011"
      },
      {
